{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"normalized":[{"from":"Body_Slam","to":"Body Slam"}],"pages":{"1828":{"pageid":1828,"ns":0,"title":"Body Slam","revisions":[{"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{Sequel Disambiguation}}\n{{Card Infobox\n| Name        = Body Slam\n| Image       = Red-BodySlam.png\n| Color       = Red\n| Type        = Attack\n| Rarity      = Common\n| Cost        = 1\n| CostPlus    = 0\n| Description = Deal damage equal to your {{KW|Block}}.\n| InteractsWith = Block\n}}\n{{Keyword Infobox|Block}}\n{{C|Body Slam}} is a 1 (0 if upgraded) {{Icon|RE}}-cost {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Red|Ironclad}} {{QueryLink|Cards|rarity:Common|Common}} {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attack}} Card. It deals damage equal to your current amount of {{KW|Block}}.\n\n== Interactions ==\n=== Order ===\n* If playing this card triggers {{R|Ornamental Fan}}, it will deal damage before gaining the additional {{KW|Block}}, meaning it will not contribute to that damage.\n\n=== Synergies ===\n* Synergizes with ways to build up block, such as {{C|Barricade}} or {{C|Blur}} to maintain it and {{C|Entrench}} to scale it.\n* If using {{R|Snecko Eye}} and upgraded with {{C|Armaments}} during combat, it's cost always turns to 0.\n\n=== Neutral ===\n* Regardless of dealing base damage equal to {{KW|Block}}, it still deals attack damage, and therefore also scales with {{BD|Strength}}.\n\n{{IroncladNav}}\n[[Category:Cards]]"}}}]}}}}